  "name": "Question 4",
  "problem": "Let $a=\u27e81,-2,3\u27e9$ and $b=\u27e81,-1,-1\u27e9.$ Find the vector projection of $a$ onto $b.$\n\n${\\text{proj}}_{b}\\,a=\u27e8$\n\n{{field-1}},\n\n{{field-2}},\n\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\u27e9$",
  "worked_solution": "Using the formula for the vector projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{b}\\,a & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{b\\cdot b}b \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot 1+(-2)\\cdot (-1)+3\\cdot (-1)}{{1}^{2}+(-1)^{2}+(-1)^{2}}b \\\\  & =\\frac{0}{3}b \\\\  & =\u27e80,0,0\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
